msgctxt "512"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Comandi"

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret>"
" to control your gaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> to stare at a particular area. Hold down"
" <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> to focus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Looking at different areas will provoke different reactions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "(Her eyes...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "(Her lips...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "(Her hands...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(Her legs...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(Her hair...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "(That's pretty nice...)"
msgstr "(Davvero gustoso...)"

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Hmm...)"
msgstr "(Mmm...)"

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Your eyes. They're just the right shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "You think so? Hehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Y'know, I like your eyes too, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"You should stop staring at me, though, or I might die from blushing too "
"hard! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "You're lips. They're so cute and plush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"I dunno why, but I feel kinda embarrassed when you stare at my mouth like "
"that... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Don't you have a hard time understanding me sometimes? I mean, I sprinkle in"
" all sorts of Okinawan words whenever I'm talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "But I like that about you. Your dialect makes you cuter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Hehehehe... Well, now I'm gonna have to do it way more! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "I love your hands. They're so tiny and cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Really? I'm kinda surprised... With the amount of chores I do around the "
"house, they've gotten all calloused and beaten up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Really? I never noticed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm pretty good at housewifey stuff. I'm a good cook, too! Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Your legs. That short dress perfectly shows them off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Wow! You're such a horndog, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Hey, I'm not that bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "C'mon, now... You just said that 'cause I'm wearing this dress today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Not at all. Your legs are slender and beautiful no matter what you wear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Mnnnnn... I mean, I'm super embarrassed about it, but also kinda happy... "
"Geez, you're making me feel weird! <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Your hair... That cut looks great on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"You really think so? You like a girl with hair this short,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san? <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"I mean, I like long hair, too, but it's such a pain! I always end up cutting"
" it short again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Ehehe... yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"All the models in the big fashion magazines have super long hair, though... "
"I should try to grow mine out, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Well... your chest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Wow! You're such a horndog, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "Hey, I'm not that bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"Man, I'm so embarrassed... I mean, I don't think my boobs look all that "
"nice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "They do, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Mnnn... You're making me mad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Heeeey! What're you looking at, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "Um, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Are you trying to be mean to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "No, that's not it."
msgstr "No, non è quello."

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"I really liked you, Kiryu-san... Maybe I should just give up on you, "
"though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "(She looks like she's having a good time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "(A silver accessory, huh...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "(Her ring?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "(Is it on her legs?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "(Maybe it's in her hair?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "(Is it her necklace?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "(A silver accessory, huh...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "You sure do love silver. You've got good taste, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"Ehehe... I bet it was obvious. It was written all over my face, wasn't it? "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Yeah, it was."
msgstr "Sì, lo è stato."

msgctxt "1220"
msgid ""
"The accessory I bought was... this necklace! The second I saw it in the "
"store, I was like, \"I've gotta buy it!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid ""
"It's the perfect accessory. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm gonna hold onto it"
" forever. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid ""
"You sure do love silver. I'm getting excited just listening to you talk "
"about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"Well, I was super happy about being able to buy it! Plus, I was sooo excited"
" for you to be the first to hear about it! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"Besides, don't you wanna talk about the things you love with the person "
"you're into?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "Yeah, that's true."
msgstr "Già, è vero."

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"The accessory I bought was... this necklace! The second I saw it in the "
"store, I was like, \"I've gotta buy it!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"It's the perfect accessory. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm gonna hold onto it"
" forever. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Did you buy a ring?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"What? Look at my hands, I'm not even wearing any rings today! C'mon, Kiryu-"
"san... I thought you cared more about me than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"The accessory I bought was... this necklace! The second I saw it in the "
"store, I was like, \"I've gotta buy it!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Oh, it was your necklace..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"I do like rings, though... But I'd rather get one as a present from the guy "
"I like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "You want a guy to give you a ring, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I'd be over the moon if you bought me a ring,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san... <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "Are you wearing it on your legs somewhere?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid ""
"Nope. There are definitely some anklets and toe rings I wanna buy, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Toe rings? They make those?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid ""
"Uh, yeah? They're just like rings, but you wear them on your toes. You've "
"really never heard of them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "No, never..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"Anyway, the accessory I bought was... this necklace! The second I saw it in "
"the store, I was like, \"I've gotta buy it!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid ""
"It's the perfect accessory. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm gonna hold onto it"
" forever. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "Are you wearing it in your hair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "Nope, that's not it. This isn't even silver."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
