msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "Is it your necklace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid ""
"Yup! I knew you'd get it. You know sooo much about me,\r\n"
"after all! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "I guess, heh."
msgstr "Immagino, heh."

msgctxt "1568"
msgid "Well, what do you think? Does it look good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid "Yeah. It's really pretty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid ""
"Ehehe... I'm so glad I was able to buy it! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default> I'm "
"gonna treasure it forever. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "Sorry... What did you buy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1616"
msgid "Oh, all riiiiight. I'll tell you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1628"
msgid ""
"It's this necklace! The second I saw it in the store, I was like, \"I've "
